msgstr "Maks. broj redaka za prikaz"

msgid "Cache Excel siblings as ODS"
msgstr "Predmemoriraj Excel srodne datoteke kao ODS"

msgid ""
"Convert sibling .xlsx/.xls to writeragent_ods_cache/ beside the folder so "
"repeated DuckDB SQL reuses the ODS. Native .ods and the live workbook are "
"never cached. Set calc.ods_cache_enabled false in writeragent.json to "
"disable."
msgstr ""
"Pretvori srodne .xlsx/.xls datoteke u writeragent_ods_cache/ pored mape kako"
" bi ponovljeni DuckDB SQL koristio ODS. Izvorne .ods datoteke i aktivna "
"radna knjiga se nikada ne predmemoriraju. Postavite calc.ods_cache_enabled "
"na false u writeragent.json za onemogućavanje."

